    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d987">

                <pb facs="0764" n="682" xml:id="pg682"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 891.51/71.</note>
                <head>[Extract]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1911-06-13"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 13, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 132.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose a translation of an act of the
                        Medjles<anchor n="1" xml:id="d987-f1"/> passed to-day, giving full powers in
                    financial matters or Treasury business to Mr. Shuster. This was passed by an
                    almost unanimous vote. Little overt opposition.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles W.
                    Russell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
